#Beverage Sales Performance Dashboard – 2022

An interactive Power BI dashboard built to analyze beverage sales performance throughout 2022.

The project focuses on understanding revenue, profitability, sales volume, monthly trends, daily sales patterns, and beverage-brand performance through an interactive dashboard.

![Beverage Sales Dashboard](dashboard.png)

---

##📌 Project Overview

The purpose of this project was to transform beverage sales data into an interactive business dashboard that can help stakeholders quickly understand sales performance and identify important trends.

The dashboard provides an overview of:

- Total Revenue
- Total Profit
- Total Units Sold
- Average Unit Price
- Monthly Revenue Trends
- Daily Revenue Trends
- Revenue by Beverage Brand
- Revenue vs. Profit by Beverage Brand
- Division and District performance

---

## 🎯 Business Questions

This analysis was designed to answer questions such as:

- How much revenue and profit were generated during 2022?
- How many beverage units were sold?
- How did revenue change throughout the year?
- Which months generated the highest revenue?
- Which beverage brands generated the most revenue?
- How does profit compare with revenue across brands?
- How can performance be explored across different divisions and districts?

---

## 📊 Key Metrics

| Metric | Result |
|---|---:|
| Total Units Sold | 16M |
| Total Revenue | 8.20M |
| Total Profit | 2.33M |
| Average Unit Price | 0.48 |

---

## 🔎 Key Findings

Some of the main observations from the dashboard include:

- Total revenue for 2022 reached approximately **8.20M**.
- Total profit was approximately **2.33M**.
- Approximately **16M units** were sold during the year.
- Revenue varied considerably throughout the year, with stronger performance during the middle and later months.
- **Coca-Cola** generated the highest revenue among the beverage brands shown.
- The dashboard allows performance to be explored at different geographic levels using Division and District filters.

---

## 🛠️ Tools & Skills

- Power BI
- DAX
- Data Visualization
- Business Analysis
- Dashboard Design
- KPI Analysis
- Interactive Filtering

---

## 📈 Dashboard Features

### KPI Overview
Provides a quick summary of total units sold, average unit price, revenue, and profit.

### Monthly Revenue Analysis
Shows how total revenue changed month by month throughout 2022.

### Daily Revenue Analysis
Provides a closer look at daily sales patterns and fluctuations.

### Brand Performance
Compares beverage brands based on revenue and profit.

### Interactive Filters
Users can filter the analysis by:

- Division
- District
- Beverage Brand

---

## 💡 Business Value

The dashboard turns sales data into an easy-to-understand visual report that can help identify strong-performing brands, revenue trends, and differences across geographic areas.

This type of analysis can support decisions related to sales performance monitoring, product focus, and regional sales strategy.

